{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04096","headline":"奉和崔尚书赠大理陆卿鸿胪刘卿见示之作 · 苏頲","name":"奉和崔尚书赠大理陆卿鸿胪刘卿见示之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戏藻嘉鱼乐，栖梧见凤飞。\n类从皆有召，声应乃无违。\n美价逢时出，奇才选衆稀。\n避堂贻後政，扫第发前几。\n出曳仙人履，还熏侍女衣。\n省中何赫奕，庭际满芳菲。\n吏部端清鉴，丞郎肃紫机。\n会心歌咏是，廻迹宴言非。\n北寺邻玄阙，南城写翠微。\n参差交隐见，髣髴接光辉。\n宾序尝柔德，刑孚已霁威。\n巨源林下契，不速自同归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04096.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04096","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}